</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>No more trying something else,</l><l>Or thinking that there’s something more;</l><l>No more hoping “someday,”</l><l>’Cause today I have the best.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Looking not at failures past,</l><l>Hoping not in future dreams;</l><l>Not wishing I were different,</l><l>Knowing everything’s the best.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
